### Get All Rooms

GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/rooms

###

### Create Room

POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "uuid": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "site_id": 1,
    "code": "CR-001",
    "name": "Cold Room 1",
    "description": "Main cold room",
    "active": 1
}

